{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":26.239999771118164,"text":"Crete has hundreds of small Byzantine chapels and villages and mountains, many with painted walls. When one of them is in danger of collapse, the paintings are detached and saved. In the museum, you see such pieces, with saints, angels, and scenes of daily life around the  Look at the hands and the eyes. They are large and strong on purpose, because the painter knew people would be looking from a distance in very little light.","words":[{"word":"Crete","start":0,"end":0.5199999809265137},{"word":"has","start":0.5199999809265137,"end":0.8799999952316284},{"word":"hundreds","start":0.8799999952316284,"end":1.2599999904632568},{"word":"of","start":1.2599999904632568,"end":1.6799999475479126},{"word":"small","start":1.6799999475479126,"end":2.0199999809265137},{"word":"Byzantine","start":2.0199999809265137,"end":2.4000000953674316},{"word":"chapels","start":2.4000000953674316,"end":2.819999933242798},{"word":"and","start":2.819999933242798,"end":3.200000047683716},{"word":"villages","start":3.200000047683716,"end":3.440000057220459},{"word":"and","start":3.440000057220459,"end":4.199999809265137},{"word":"mountains","start":4.199999809265137,"end":4.199999809265137},{"word":"many","start":4.739999771118164,"end":4.760000228881836},{"word":"with","start":4.760000228881836,"end":5.059999942779541},{"word":"painted","start":5.059999942779541,"end":5.300000190734863},{"word":"walls","start":5.300000190734863,"end":5.699999809265137},{"word":"When","start":6.380000114440918,"end":6.5},{"word":"one","start":6.5,"end":6.679999828338623},{"word":"of","start":6.679999828338623,"end":6.920000076293945},{"word":"them","start":6.920000076293945,"end":6.920000076293945},{"word":"is","start":6.920000076293945,"end":7.059999942779541},{"word":"in","start":7.059999942779541,"end":7.460000038146973},{"word":"danger","start":7.460000038146973,"end":7.519999980926514},{"word":"of","start":7.519999980926514,"en